  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v5.8.6 - GGUF Q8_0 weights regrouped in place on the device (GGMLType.Q8_0G, no extra memory): every reader (one-row and multi-row GEMVs, the tensor-core and tiled prefill, the embedding) reads 16-byte chunks. Qwen3-1.7B Q8_0 decode in Chrome WebGPU 147 -> 166 tok/s on an RTX 4070 (CUDA +1.5%). GgufBatchDecoder.ProfileRecordedStepAsync: per-kernel GPU time of a WebGPU decode step. Full notes: CHANGELOG.md.",
